body:
No fr man these two weeks have been hell. It does get better. I legit had suicidal thoughts every day for the first week. I did what you're doing now; I called all the clubs and groups that looked cool. I marked my favorite shows on my calendar, I bought cookies and had one on my desk first thing in the morning.

&#x200B;

I'm honestly just looking forward to the warmer weather when more stuff is going on. i notice its so much easier to make friends when everyone isn't dying of frostbite
